Senate proposal of amendment
H. 171
An act relating to criminal justice agency protocols for an officer-involved
shooting.
The Senate proposes to the House to amend the bill in Sec. 1, officer-
involved shooting protocol, in subdivision (c)(5), after “independent
assessments” by inserting “and the role of victim advocates”

